You take the backpack off your back, and sink slowly on the ground, right on the soft underlayer of grass. You can hardly keep your eyes open, your mind is clouded. And it`s strange, because you have just had a fine rest... The night was not pleasant, but still...
You close your eyes and steep in deep slumber which you will never overcome. Fragrance of flowers is like narcosis that takes effect unless you stop inhaling it. Your adventure ends here.